  loreText: 'THE LAST CANTOR WOULD NOT STOP COUNTING. HE COUNTS FOUR, THEN THREE, THEN SEVEN, AND RAISES HIS STAFF A BAR BEFORE HE CHANGES. WHEN HE LEAPS, THE GROUND ITSELF STRIKES: NO BLADE TURNS IT. LEAVE THE GROUND.'
